  "details": "The new instance announcement feature has an audit log entry for the group. (YAY!)\n\nBut there's no instanceID in the entry!  (Sadge)\n\nPlease add instanceID to the audit log entry for instance announcements.\n\nCurrent example data:\n\ncreated_at,\n\neventType,\n\nactorDisplayName,\n\ndescription,data\n\n2026-05-29T23:33:50.172Z,\n\ngroup.instance.announcement,\n\n<<displayName>>,\n\nGroup instance announcement created by <<displayName>>,\n\n\"{\"\"message\"\":\"\"Test announcement for tool production\"\",\"\"title\"\":\"\"Instance Announcement\"\"}\"",
